---
// TypicalResults.astro - UK specific section with careful, non-guaranteed language
---

<section class="py-20 bg-bg-base section-fade-in">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-4">
        What you can expect
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-text-secondary max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Based on our experience working with UK service businesses, here's what typically happens after launch.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12 icon-list">
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-8 text-center icon-list-item">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-accent-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-accent-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-3">First 2–3 months</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          UK service businesses typically start seeing inbound enquiries within the first 2–3 months as search engines index your site.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-8 text-center icon-list-item">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-accent-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-accent-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-3">Once established</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Once established, many sites generate around 10–15 enquiries per month, depending on your service and location.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-8 text-center icon-list-item">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-accent-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-accent-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-3">Long-term growth</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Over time, consistent visibility builds trust and reputation, leading to more referrals and repeat business.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Disclaimer -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-6 border-border-subtle">
        <div class="flex items-start">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-text-tertiary mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-text-secondary">Important:</strong> Results vary depending on location, competition, and service type. The figures above are indicative based on our experience and should not be taken as a promise of specific outcomes. Every business is different.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
